  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equipment Support for Health Training Institutions - ESHTI.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support assessment of accreditation needs in 12 health training institutions (funded through complimentary DHSC programme) and provide Capital accreditation requirements to at least 12 health training institutions following assessment. The project will also improve equipment maintenance in supported health training institutions (funded by WHO through their own funds, complementing FCDO funding through ESHTI).</narrative>
  </description>
